Exercise 1 of Module 3, generated by Copilot CLI. Chromium-only Playwright
setup for the AssetTrack web UI and a focused accessibility spec under
tests/playwright/ using role and label locators for dashboard landmarks,
navigation active state, keyboard access (Enter, not Space), asset list
filters, and the new asset form. Ignores generated Playwright output.

